# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout for all platforms.
#
# The ws plugin ships text docs (skills, rsrc payloads, mental models) whose
# content is asserted byte-for-byte by the Go test suite. Without this, a
# Windows checkout under core.autocrlf converts them to CRLF, and shipped-doc
# content assertions (e.g. internal/mcp playbook tests) fail on Windows CI while
# passing on Linux/macOS. `text=auto` still lets git auto-detect and leave
# binary files untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated single-file Pi extension bundle (scripts/bundle.mjs); review src/ instead.
agents-plugin-pi/dist/** linguist-generated=true -diff
